### ==============================================================
### ErrorBoundary Test Workflow - HTTP Test File
### ==============================================================
### Bu dosya ErrorBoundary feature'ının tüm senaryolarını test eder.
### Test Senaryoları:
### 1. Task-Level ErrorBoundary (Retry, Abort)
### 2. State-Level ErrorBoundary (Ignore, Rollback)
### 3. SubFlow ErrorBoundary (Error Propagation)
### 4. Retry Policies (Fixed, Exponential Backoff)
### 5. Timeout Policy
### 6. Notify Action
### 7. Global ErrorBoundary
### ==============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = error-boundary-test-workflow
@instanceKey = error-boundary-test-{{$timestamp}}

### ==============================================================
### STEP 1: Start the ErrorBoundary Test Workflow
### ==============================================================
### Bu adım workflow'u başlatır ve test-task-boundary state'ine geçer.
### Global ErrorBoundary aktiftir ve tüm beklenmeyen hatalar için 
### Notify ve Log action'ları tanımlıdır.

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "{{instanceKey}}",
  "tags": ["error-boundary-test", "test"],
  "attributes": {
    "testId": "eb-test-{{$timestamp}}",
    "testStartedAt": "{{$datetime rfc1123}}",
    "testScenarios": [
      "task-boundary-retry",
      "task-boundary-abort",
      "state-boundary-ignore",
      "state-boundary-rollback",
      "subflow-error-propagation",
      "retry-policies",
      "timeout-policy",
      "notify-action"
    ]
  }
}

### ==============================================================
### STEP 2: Get Current State (Long Polling)
### ==============================================================
### Workflow'un mevcut durumunu kontrol eder.

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state

### ==============================================================
### STEP 3: Get Instance Data
### ==============================================================
### Workflow instance verisini alır.

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/data

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO: Test Task-Level Retry (503 Error with Exponential Backoff)
### ==============================================================
### test-task-boundary state'inde 503 hatası simüle edilir.
### Task-level ErrorBoundary ile retry policy devreye girer:
### - maxRetries: 3
### - initialDelay: 1s
### - backoffType: Exponential
### - backoffMultiplier: 2.0

### Not: Bu senaryo otomatik olarak çalışır, kullanıcı müdahalesi gerekmez.
### Retry sonuçlarını instance data'da görebilirsiniz.

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO: Test State-Level Ignore (400 Error)
### ==============================================================
### test-state-boundary state'inde 400 hatası oluşur.
### State-level ErrorBoundary tanımına göre:
### - action: Ignore (3)
### - errorCodes: [400, 404, 422]
### Hata ignore edilir ve workflow devam eder.

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO: Test SubFlow Error Propagation
### ==============================================================
### test-subflow-boundary state'inde SubFlow çağrılır.
### SubFlow içinde hata oluştuğunda:
### - SubFlowErrorPolicy.propagateToParent: true
### - SubFlowErrorPolicy.includeChildErrorDetails: true
### - SubFlowErrorPolicy.parentTransition: "subflow-error-recovery"
### Hata parent workflow'a iletilir.

### ==============================================================
### SCENARIO: Test Timeout Policy
### ==============================================================
### test-timeout-policy state'inde timeout simüle edilir.
### State-level ErrorBoundary.onTimeout ayarı:
### - action: Abort
### - transition: "timeout-state"
### - defaultRetryPolicy ile önce retry denenir

### ==============================================================
### ALTERNATIVE FLOW: Manual Review Transition (Review Approved)
### ==============================================================
### Eğer workflow manual-review state'ine geçtiyse:

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/review-approved
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewedBy": "admin",
  "reviewedAt": "{{$datetime rfc1123}}",
  "decision": "approved",
  "notes": "Error reviewed and approved for continuation"
}

### ==============================================================
### ALTERNATIVE FLOW: Manual Review Transition (Review Rejected)
### ==============================================================
### Eğer workflow manual-review state'ine geçtiyse ve red kararı:

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/review-rejected
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewedBy": "admin",
  "reviewedAt": "{{$datetime rfc1123}}",
  "decision": "rejected",
  "notes": "Error reviewed and rejected"
}

### ==============================================================
### MONITORING: Check Final State
### ==============================================================
### Workflow tamamlandığında final state'i kontrol edin:
### - success: Tüm testler başarılı
### - failed: Rollback veya timeout sonrası

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state

### ==============================================================
### MONITORING: Get Full Instance Data with Test Results
### ==============================================================
### Tüm test sonuçlarını içeren instance data:

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/data

### ==============================================================
### ERROR BOUNDARY TEST SCENARIOS SUMMARY
### ==============================================================
### 
### | Level    | ErrorAction | Scenario                              |
### |----------|-------------|---------------------------------------|
### | Task     | Retry (1)   | HTTP 503 - exponential backoff retry |
### | Task     | Abort (0)   | HTTP 500 - abort and transition      |
### | State    | Ignore (3)  | HTTP 400 - ignore and continue       |
### | State    | Rollback(2) | HTTP 500 - rollback to prev state    |
### | SubFlow  | Propagate   | Child error propagates to parent     |
### | Global   | Notify (4)  | All unexpected errors notify         |
### | Global   | Log (5)     | All errors are logged                |
### | Timeout  | Abort+Trans | Timeout leads to specific state      |
###
### ErrorAction Enum Values:
### - 0: Abort
### - 1: Retry
### - 2: Rollback
### - 3: Ignore
### - 4: Notify
### - 5: Log
###
### BackoffType Enum Values:
### - 0: Fixed
### - 1: Exponential
###
### ==============================================================

### ==============================================================
### CLEANUP: Delete Test Instance (Optional)
### ==============================================================
### Test sonrası instance'ı silmek için:

# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}

